sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant SERVICE_A
    participant SERVICE_B
    participant KAFKA
    participant DB

    Client->>SERVICE_A: POST /request (payload)
    activate SERVICE_A

    SERVICE_A->>SERVICE_B: POST /process (computed data)
    activate SERVICE_B

    SERVICE_B->>KAFKA: Produce message (stream data)
    activate KAFKA

    KAFKA->>DB: Consume & Insert data
    activate DB

    DB-->>KAFKA: Insert Ack
    deactivate DB

    KAFKA-->>SERVICE_B: Stream Ack / Confirmation
    deactivate KAFKA

    SERVICE_B-->>SERVICE_A: Response (success/failure)
    deactivate SERVICE_B

    SERVICE_A-->>Client: Final Response (200/500 etc.)
    deactivate SERVICE_A